Fia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;background-size: 16px auto !important;height: 902.666667px !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           胡宁区域在秘鲁中部，是上图橙色部分，图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            关于雷米农场\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           雷米农场的故事始于2020年12月，\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Richard\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           从一位同样从事咖啡种植的朋友兼同行，获得转让了部分土地。2021年初，在NARSA咖啡公司主管的支持下，Richard开始开垦这片土地，并种下了瑰夏咖啡。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b6ptib9gFX6vdEbjgKibJgg8dWFVbSlfeqG2kGOAkCwkJnn95Yr4wpZEicskN6ry8SpNJVibZlWNqy4OBT2M38UkEfWohCJRN8IL4Y/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           最初几年的精心呵护至关重要。到了2023年，农场收获了首批50公斤咖啡生豆，随后Richard带着它们参加了卓越杯和黄金杯竞赛。正是在这些比赛中，他发现了自家咖啡豆的巨大潜力。2024年，随着加工处理的改进，农场在胡宁杯大赛中荣获季军，这一成就标志着新征程的开启。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b5CicNSPRzEdeARyxOHpJWlQwRfqDdFENE8micfDZopflQdLaAatiarr8dgoefZ8ibatcsqck9I7H05wzYDcvtz8qjictZ08sJtbvvQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           2025年，Richard决定再次角逐卓越杯，他倾注了大量心血、不断学习钻研的蜜处理咖啡。每一颗咖啡豆都凝聚着全家的辛勤付出、朋友们的鼎力支持，最终获得了第九名的好成绩；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;border-radius: 8px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);background-size: 16px auto !important;height: 187.85px !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
